message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the archived release."
title: "Altermagnet inverse design - code and data"
abstract: >-
  Data, trained XGBoost surrogate, and code behind a quantitative inverse-design
  study of altermagnetic spin splitting. Introduces the Motif Symmetry-Breaking
  Index (MSBI), a continuous structure-only scalar for how strongly two
  antiparallel magnetic motifs break the translation and inversion relations
  that would otherwise enforce spin degeneracy, and applies interpretable
  machine learning to 3,845 DFT-labelled binary structures.
